  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Sanitation, Hygiene and Water in Nigeria (Shawn)/UNICEF: Multilateral Contribution is a component of Sanitation, Hygiene and Water in Nigeria (Shawn) Project reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xA3;29,574,997. It works in the following sector(s): Basic drinking water supply and basic sanitation, Water sector policy and administrative management, Education and training in water supply and sanitation.</narrative>
  </description>
